# The faces the fonts of the pages are made from: the first family of these that the machine has, with every
# character a need asks for, as the examples' rules choose (DGX's docs/fonts-en.md, "Selection rules"). Sizes are in
# pixels.
source system
allow "DejaVu Sans"      7..
allow "Liberation Sans"  7..
allow "Noto Sans"        7..
allow "FreeSans"         7..
allow "Arial"            7..
